                                                                    <section class="next-section" id="data-processed" data-content-section data-search-item data-search-text="1. Data We Process We process account registration data, wallet balances, transaction records, verification documents where required, and technical security logs. For authenticated accounts, we also store a last-activity timestamp, rate-limited to one update per minute, to calculate an aggregate active-member count. Public ticket checking does not store personal identity." aria-labelledby="data-processed-title"><div class="next-section__heading"><span class="next-section__number">01</span><div><p class="next-eyebrow">গোপনীয়তা নীতির অংশ</p><h2 id="data-processed-title">1. Data We Process</h2></div></div><div class="next-section__body"><p>We process account registration data, wallet balances, transaction records, verification documents where required, and technical security logs. For authenticated accounts, we also store a last-activity timestamp, rate-limited to one update per minute, to calculate an aggregate active-member count. Public ticket checking does not store personal identity.</p></div></section>\n
                                                                    <section class="next-section" id="public-surfaces" data-content-section data-search-item data-search-text="2. Public &amp; Anonymous Surfaces Home, draw results, prize checking, and public sales information are completely anonymous. No user login is required to browse results, and other users&#039; personal details or balances are never exposed." aria-labelledby="public-surfaces-title"><div class="next-section__heading"><span class="next-section__number">02</span><div><p class="next-eyebrow">গোপনীয়তা নীতির অংশ</p><h2 id="public-surfaces-title">2. Public &amp; Anonymous Surfaces</h2></div></div><div class="next-section__body"><p>Home, draw results, prize checking, and public sales information are completely anonymous. No user login is required to browse results, and other users&#039; personal details or balances are never exposed.</p></div></section>\n
                                                                    <section class="next-section" id="security-storage" data-content-section data-search-item data-search-text="3. Security &amp; Storage All data transmissions are protected via modern TLS encryption. Sensitive identity documents are stored securely on private disks with restricted access and immutable audit logging." aria-labelledby="security-storage-title"><div class="next-section__heading"><span class="next-section__number">03</span><div><p class="next-eyebrow">গোপনীয়তা নীতির অংশ</p><h2 id="security-storage-title">3. Security &amp; Storage</h2></div></div><div class="next-section__body"><p>All data transmissions are protected via modern TLS encryption. Sensitive identity documents are stored securely on private disks with restricted access and immutable audit logging.</p></div></section>\n
                                                                    <section class="next-section" id="player-rights" data-content-section data-search-item data-search-text="4. Player Rights &amp; KYC You can review and update your profile details in your account dashboard. Verification documents can be managed according to the platform&#039;s compliance retention schedule." aria-labelledby="player-rights-title"><div class="next-section__heading"><span class="next-section__number">04</span><div><p class="next-eyebrow">গোপনীয়তা নীতির অংশ</p><h2 id="player-rights-title">4. Player Rights &amp; KYC</h2></div></div><div class="next-section__body"><p>You can review and update your profile details in your account dashboard. Verification documents can be managed according to the platform&#039;s compliance retention schedule.</p></div></section>\n
                                                                    <section class="next-section" id="inquiries-contact" data-content-section data-search-item data-search-text="5. Inquiries &amp; Contact For any questions or data requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact our support team through the official contact channels." aria-labelledby="inquiries-contact-title"><div class="next-section__heading"><span class="next-section__number">05</span><div><p class="next-eyebrow">গোপনীয়তা নীতির অংশ</p><h2 id="inquiries-contact-title">5. Inquiries &amp; Contact</h2></div></div><div class="next-section__body"><p>For any questions or data requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact our support team through the official contact channels.</p></div></section>\n
